        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "🌟 5 stars - Calme Spa 🌟\n\nI'm beyond impressed with Calme Spa, and it's all thanks to Nathalie's incredible talent! 😍 Her massages are THE BEST I've had in years - she has a SOOTHING, healing touch with just the right pressure 💆. Honestly, she's helped me get through some tough times. The spa's recently renovated, and wow, it's beautiful 🛋️ - you sink into healing vibes the moment you walk in. I've tried a few of Nathalie's services, and... WOW!! 😲 Amazing doesn't even cover it. Highly recommend Calme Spa and Nathalie - you need this in your life 🙏.",
        "time": 1766836953,
        "translated": false
