        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "I had the collagen treatment with Cheyenne, she was amazing really enjoyed my experience and my skin felt and looked amazing! I had a package deal with massage, really loved it! I can’t wait to get the treatment again. Highly recommended!",
        "time": 1717178683,
