      },
      {
        "author_name": "Vince Mercuri",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110869699940739124940/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJrBHYm7otT-W3caHL5JvKh3hpYeEHCTnL_xXZjMpN6jKIZ8g=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Calme Spa is an amazing experience with a wonderfully kind staff. I've gone for multiple massages (and will continue to go) while my Fiancé has gone for various beauty and relaxation treatments. I've had extremely good experiences and highly recommend this place to anybody looking to relax.",
        "time": 1709907562,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jen Lynn",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113246978340889578426/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVnDtAEh9D69pRg5MqRAY8SiQxsjHK6-WO59dq4KOCPe-g4vaYe=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "I recently had an incredible facial at Calme Spa! From the moment I stepped into the spa, warmly greeted by the friendly staff who made me feel instantly comfortable. The ambiance was serene and relaxing, creating the perfect environment for a tranquil experience. The esthetician was highly skilled and tailored the facial to my specific needs (Bloomea machine showed exceptional results after just the first time!), leaving my skin feeling refreshed and revitalized. The overall experience was nothing short of amazing",
